        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) Union's Responsibilities ~ The Union agrees that it will do everything within its power to cause the employees covered by this Agreement, individually and collectively, to perform and render loyal and efficient work and service and shall not tolerate featherbedding or take any action which would create any unnecessary work. The Union recognizes the responsibilities imposed upon it as the exclusive bargaining agency of the employees covered by this Agreement and will use its influence and best efforts to protect the Company's property and interests.",
